                "metadata": {
                    "category": "stories",
                    "author": "H. A. Rey & Margret Rey",
                    "description": "George can do all kinds of tricks on his new bicycle—even popping a wheelie! When the Man with the Yellow Hat tells him not to go too far, George gets curious and sets off on a journey through his neighborhood. From helping the paperboy with his route to offering a bugle to an ostrich to helping a bear down from a tree, this classic story will be sure to entertain young audiences.",
